{"path":"thread/thread/id/operator_ltlt","title":"operator<<(std::thread::id)","titleHtml":"operator&lt;&lt;<small>(std::thread::id)</small>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/thread/id/operator_ltlt","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"Writes a textual representation of a thread identifier id to the output stream ost.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/thread\">&lt;thread&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; operator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT,Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> ost, <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread/id\"><span class=\"kw2168\">std::<span class=\"me2\">thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">id</span></span></a> id <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Writes a textual representation of a thread identifier <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">id</span></code> to the output stream <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ost</span></code>. \n</p><p>If two thread identifiers compare equal, they have identical textual representations; if they do not compare equal, their representations are distinct.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ost\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> output stream to insert the data into\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> id\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> thread identifier\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ost</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;thread&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread\"><span class=\"kw2167\">std::<span class=\"me2\">thread</span></span></a> t1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2170\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>256ms<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/thread\"><span class=\"kw2167\">std::<span class=\"me2\">thread</span></span></a> t2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/sleep_for\"><span class=\"kw2170\">std::<span class=\"me2\">this_thread</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">sleep_for</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>512ms<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/clog\"><span class=\"kw1779\">std::<span class=\"me2\">clog</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> t1.<span class=\"me1\">get_id</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> t2.<span class=\"me1\">get_id</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    t1.<span class=\"me1\">join</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    t2.<span class=\"me1\">join</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>141592653589793\n141421356237309</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"},{"path":"thread/thread","title":"std::thread"},{"path":"thread/thread/id","title":"std::thread::id"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"operator<<(std::thread::id)","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Writes a textual representation of a thread identifier id to the output stream ost."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"ost, id"},{"label":"Return value","note":"ost"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":112,"codeBlockCount":2}
